EN:
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}I'm here to let ya know the
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} Reset Surveillance
Center{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is open!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Since this town's been so gracious
as to restore the center...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}I'm guessing the mayor of this town{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}wants me to put those no-good
resetters in their place! Yeah!
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}That's what I think anyway.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}So next time ya "forget" to reset,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I'll be bringin' the thunder! BOOM!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Sana {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} Reset Gözetim Merkezi'nin{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
açıldığını haber vermeye geldim!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Kasaba merkezi yeniden kuracak kadar
cömert davrandığına göre...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Sanırım
bu kasabanın başkanı{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}reset atan haylazları hizaya sokmamı
istiyor! Aynen!
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Ben böyle düşünüyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}Bir dahaki sefere reset atmayı
"unutursan",{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} gök gürültüsüyle gelirim! GÜM!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ah, por cierto,{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} la entrada al centro
está prohibida a todo el mundo.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡Eso te incluye a ti! ¡Son las reglas!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Dunque,{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} a seguito della riapertura
del {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Centro Sorveglianza Resetti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}... mi sembra d'uopo
presentarmi come si deve{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Mi chiamo {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Sonny Resetti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}... ma tutti mi chiamano {{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}{{TAG:0002:0005:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}signor Resetti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, visto che sono{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0002:0008:}}
un onorato pubblico ufficiale!{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
Piacere di conoscerti!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ah, y otra cosa:{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} está prohibido
tajantemente entrar en mi centro.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡Lo siento, pero así son las cosas!
